json_data:
{
  "type": "bubble",
  "size": "standard",
  "body": {
    "type": "box",
    "layout": "vertical",
    "backgroundColor": "#FFFFFF",
    "paddingAll": "24px",
    "contents": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "✨ 服務評價邀請",
        "color": "#06C755",
        "weight": "bold",
        "size": "xs",
        "letterSpacing": "1px"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "感謝您今天的諮詢！",
        "weight": "bold",
        "size": "lg",
        "color": "#111111",
        "margin": "md"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "本次對話已結束。為了提供更優質的服務，誠摯邀請您花費 5 秒鐘，為本次客服人員的服務進行評價：",
        "color": "#666666",
        "size": "xs",
        "margin": "md",
        "wrap": true
      },
      {
        "type": "box",
        "layout": "vertical",
        "margin": "xxl",
        "backgroundColor": "#F9F9F9",
        "paddingAll": "16px",
        "cornerRadius": "md",
        "contents": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐",
            "size": "xl",
            "align": "center"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "非常滿意，極力推薦！",
            "size": "xs",
            "color": "#888888",
            "align": "center",
            "margin": "xs"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "footer": {
    "type": "box",
    "layout": "vertical",
    "backgroundColor": "#FFFFFF",
    "paddingAll": "24px",
    "paddingTop": "0px",
    "spacing": "sm",
    "contents": [
      {
        "type": "button",
        "action": {
          "type": "postback",
          "label": "🌟 給予 5 星好評",
          "data": "action=rate_service&stars=5"
        },
        "style": "primary",
        "color": "#06C755",
        "height": "sm"
      },
      {
        "type": "button",
        "action": {
          "type": "postback",
          "label": "其他評價反饋",
          "data": "action=rate_service&stars=other"
        },
        "style": "text",
        "color": "#888888",
        "height": "sm"
      }
    ]
  }
}

{
